('Anghel, C., A. A. Anghel, A. S. Balau, M. V. Craciun, A. Cocu, S. Moldovanu, and C. Sandu. 2026. ClaimArena-LLM: Auditing Adversarial Propagation of False Causal Attributions in Multi-Agent LLM Debates. Machine Learning and Knowledge Extraction 8(10):327.','https://doi.org/10.3390/make8100327'),
